---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="about - impurrfect" description="Discover the story behind The Impurrfect Speakeasy — where wabi-sabi philosophy meets handcrafted cocktails.">
  <section class="space-y-12">
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-widest text-[#F6F3EF] uppercase">
        Our Story
      </h1>
      <div class="h-[1px] w-16 bg-[#875A2A] mx-auto"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 font-body text-sm text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <span class="font-accent text-[#F6F3EF]">Impurrfect</span> was born from a simple belief: perfection is overrated. Inspired by the Japanese philosophy of <span class="font-accent italic text-[#F6F3EF]">wabi-sabi</span> — finding beauty in imperfection, transience, and the incomplete — our speakeasy is a sanctuary for the flawed, the unconventional, and the authentically crafted.
      </p>
      <p>
        Tucked away from the city's rush, we invite you to leave your expectations at the door. Every cocktail on our menu is a study in contrast: smokey and sweet, bitter and bright, familiar yet unexpected. Our bartenders are not just mixologists — they are artisans who believe that a drink's character lies in its imperfections.
      </p>
      <p>
        The cracked ceramic holds more stories than the pristine one. The slightly uneven pour carries more soul. Here, we celebrate the beauty of what's broken, battered, and beautifully imperfect.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-[#33363A] pt-8 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
        <span class="font-accent text-[#875A2A] text-xs tracking-widest uppercase min-w-[80px]">Hours</span>
        <span class="font-body text-sm text-stone-400">
          Mon–Sat · 6 PM — 2 AM<br />
          Sunday · Closed
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
        <span class="font-accent text-[#875A2A] text-xs tracking-widest uppercase min-w-[80px]">Location</span>
        <span class="font-body text-sm text-stone-400">
          123 Hidden Lane, Basement Level<br />
          Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
        <span class="font-accent text-[#875A2A] text-xs tracking-widest uppercase min-w-[80px]">Contact</span>
        <span class="font-body text-sm text-stone-400">
          hello@impurrfect.com
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a
        href="/bar-menu"
        class="inline-block bg-[#875A2A] text-[#F6F3EF] font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-[#6b4620] transition-colors duration-200 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase"
      >
        View Our Menu
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
